---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Pricing — WhisperFlow"
  description="WhisperFlow core is free forever, unlimited, Apache-2.0. An optional hosted Cloud may arrive for weak hardware — the core stays free."
>
  <section class="hero-backdrop border-b border-line/70">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 text-center sm:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Free. Really.</h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-ink-dim">
        The core app is unlimited and open-source forever. Hardware is the only meter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-line/70">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border-2 border-accent/60 bg-surface/60 p-8">
          <p class="absolute -top-3 left-6 rounded-full bg-accent px-3 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-bg">
            CORE — SHIPS NOW
          </p>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">WhisperFlow Core</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold">$0<span class="text-base font-normal text-ink-dim"> forever</span></p>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-dim">
            <li>✓ Unlimited dictation — no word caps, ever</li>
            <li>✓ Local transcription (whisper.cpp) + local AI polish (llama.cpp)</li>
            <li>✓ Personal dictionary, voice commands, tones</li>
            <li>✓ Local history with search</li>
            <li>✓ Local-only network lock</li>
            <li>✓ Commercial use permitted (Apache-2.0)</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-8">
            <Button href="/download/">Download</Button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface/40 p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-ink-dim">EXPLORING — NOT SHIPPING YET</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold">WhisperFlow Cloud</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold text-ink-dim">TBD</p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-dim">
            Optional hosted inference for machines that can't run models locally — same app,
            same dictionary, remote speed. The core stays free and unlimited regardless; cloud
            would only ever be an add-on for those who choose it.
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-dim">
            <li>· BYO-endpoint support already built in (any OpenAI-compatible API)</li>
            <li>· Hosted tier only if the community wants it</li>
            <li>· Local-only lock stays available in every version</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface/60 p-8 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Support development</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-ink-dim">
          WhisperFlow is built in the open. Sponsors fund model-hosting experiments, hardware
          for CI, and maintainer time.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center gap-3">
          <Button href="/sponsors/" variant="ghost">Become a sponsor</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
